AI Reflection

For this lab, I used ChatGPT to help me organize the sections of my README and to check my code after I ran it. I used ChatGPT to help me understand what needed to be included in the README and to help identify a bug after I tested my program.

One decision I made was to use ChatGPT to review my code after I ran it and noticed that something was not working correctly. ChatGPT helped me look at the code and understand what was causing the problem. I used that explanation to correct rather than just copying an answer without understanding it.

For verification, I ran both programs myself and compared the actual output with the expected results I calculated beforehand. This helped me confirm that the programs were working correctly after the bug was fixed.

One thing I can now do myself is organize a README with the required information and understand the basic calculations in my programs. I still need to practice finding and fixing bugs in C++ on my own and becoming more comfortable with the syntax.
